git apply fixes-code-only.patchFrom 929f778bcc4725d146f1cf2182b7d632b8c3b433 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 17:25:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix sizing, contrast, and add remaining transition
 illustrations

- Recompress all illustrations/icons smaller (6.6MB -> ~2.7MB + 2 new files)
- Module illustrations: wrap in tinted+shaded card, shrink to ~68% width
- Body as Your Vehicle: remove duplicate diagram, show single labeled illustration
- VisaStamp: recenter plane icon within stamp circle
- Transition: add real illustrations for last 2 missing (Fitland->Assetland, Assetland->Mindland) from user uploads
- Shrink Welcome hero, Terminal banner, VisaQuestion illustration to ~85-92% width
---
